OL,4,CHuawei found guilty of stealing US     
OL,5,Ctrade secrets but acquitted of         
OL,6,Cracketeering                           
OL,7,GHuawei has been found guilty of        
OL,8,Gconspiracy to steal trade secrets and  
OL,9,Gbank fraud, but not guilty of the more 
OL,10,Gserious overarching racketeering       
OL,11,Gcharge in a landmark case in the US.   
OL,13,FIn a two-month trial, prosecutors      
OL,14,Faccused the Chinese technology and     
OL,15,Ftelecommunications giant of lying,     
OL,16,Fcheating and stealing to gain any      
OL,17,Fcompetitive advantage.                 
